    {
      "id": "claim_b27a712f2f794dd7b647d1503130025b",
      "statement": "In password mode the client computes an argon2id hash (salt SERVICE_SALT + username) and sends only that hash to login()/createAccount(); the server does not store that hash either, applying a further server-side hash before persistence so the raw password is never seen by the server.",
